{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/presentacion.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeedGod</strong> is a roguelike deck builder inspired by the 1990 game Minesweeper. In this game, you must strategically plant crops in a field infested with bugs, and not planting is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where is the bug?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/donde.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the numbers to guide you on where to plant and where not to plant your crops. If there\u2019s a 1, I wouldn\u2019t plant around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The bugs can be aggressive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/god.png?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only are they aggressive when you accidentally touch them, but they are also difficult to catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique plants and tools.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/cardis.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some players hoard the best plants and tools, but if you have money, you can surely get them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The smell of newness reaches here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/abrill.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes the merchant will be willing to sell you packages that can be very interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Gardener: Did you know that plants produce seeds?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/palpitar.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you plant in the garden, the chance of one of your plants producing a seed increases with each plant sown. It might give you an epic seed, or it might not.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343480?t=1744466569","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/f27a6db10a8fb6bc0bfe681d13672aa2da7e0721/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744466569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/a5a55e2d0defbdda73928d39bff7b5a4baa0a55b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744466569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/a5a55e2d0defbdda73928d39bff7b5a4baa0a55b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744466569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/presentacion.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeedGod</strong> is a roguelike deck builder inspired by the 1990 game Minesweeper. In this game, you must strategically plant crops in a field infested with bugs, and not planting is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where is the bug?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/donde.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the numbers to guide you on where to plant and where not to plant your crops. If there\u2019s a 1, I wouldn\u2019t plant around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The bugs can be aggressive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/god.png?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only are they aggressive when you accidentally touch them, but they are also difficult to catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique plants and tools.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/cardis.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some players hoard the best plants and tools, but if you have money, you can surely get them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The smell of newness reaches here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/abrill.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes the merchant will be willing to sell you packages that can be very interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Gardener: Did you know that plants produce seeds?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/palpitar.gif?t=1744466569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you plant in the garden, the chance of one of your plants producing a seed increases with each plant sown. It might give you an epic seed, or it might not.</p>","developers":["El Diablillo Pandori"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/57cf2aba4e17b1a372f3c4ab0d5afa7c488dc5b4/header.jpg?t=1744466569","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257110722,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110722/movie480.mp4?t=1743969897","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110722/movie_max.mp4?t=1743969897"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110722/4af1654a517d87575ea6744b021d3318445b7e82/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743969897","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110722/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743969897","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110722/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743969897"}}],"name":"SeedGod","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible graphics card, integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 185 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requiere un procesador y un sistema operativo de 64 bits</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Pandorami Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q2 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"p